1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,062
AI assistants are trapped behind information silos.

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:08,850
Anthropic's Model Context Protocol is one open standard connecting AI to your data.

3
00:00:09,262 --> 00:00:14,375
An MCP server exposes your data; an MCP client like Claude connects to it.

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:20,850
Pre-built MCP servers exist for Google Drive, Slack, GitHub, Postgres and Puppeteer.

5
00:00:21,262 --> 00:00:23,238
Build once, integrate everywhere.

6
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:25,125
AI finally reaches your data.

